<blockquote data-start=3D"5019" data-end=3D"6056">
<p data-start=3D"5021" data-end=3D"6056">Generate a 6-panel candidate board=
 of publication-style research framework diagrams for SemiDFL. Each panel s=
hould be a different schematic layout skeleton for the same method. Fixed c=
ontent: decentralized federated learning without a central server; heteroge=
neous L-client, U-client, and M-client; non-IID data; Neighborhood Pseudo-L=
abeling using local and neighbor classifiers; diffusion-based generated dat=
a; Consensus MixUp combining labeled, pseudo-labeled, and generated data; c=
lassifier training; generated-data evaluation; adaptive aggregation weights=
; consensus data space; consensus model space. Vary only the layout and nar=
rative organization across panels: A two-level overview, B three contributi=
on modules, C round-level loop, D dual-space construction, E data-flow/mode=
l-flow dual channel, F global overview with mechanism insets. Use clean aca=
demic vector schematic style, white background, readable English labels, th=
in arrows, soft colors, medium density, no realistic photos, no 3D, no clut=
ter. Label each panel A-F.</p>
</blockquote>
